re a lot of ideas on what makes  an empirian but there are two ideas that  rise above all the others the first is  that an empirian is simply a demigod or  god chosen by two fingers and the second  is that imperials are special beings  born of a single god  we'll discuss both ideas but let's start  with the first one in that imperiums are  chosen by two fingers  this idea came from a conversation with  ronnie which goes  let us speak of the past a while  i was once an imperial  of the demigods  only i  mickeler and melania could claim that  title  each of us was chosen by our own two  fingers  as a candidate to succeed queen america  to become the new god of the coming age  which is when i received blithe  in the form of a vassal tailored for  imperial  but i would not acquiesce to the two  fingers  i stole the rune of death  slew mine own imperium flesh  casting it away  i would not be controlled by that thing  the two fingers and i have been cursing  each other ever since  and the baleful shadows  are their assassins  i turned my back on the two fingers  and we have each been cursing the other  since  the baleful shadows  are their assassins  as you saw the most important bit was  that ronnie mentioned that each of them  were chosen by their own two fingers  which is what made them imperiance this  is the main crux of the argument the one  thing confirmed in common with all the  imperials thus far is that they're all  chosen by a two fingers although we  don't really get to see mykola or  melania's two fingers unless you count  the dead two fingers on the divine  towers the two fingers are usually  associated with a greater will but  they're just agents of the greater will  itself so many interpret this as more of  being chosen by an outer god  this is further supported by the fact  that the gloam-eyed queen was chosen by  fingers as well not necessarily the two  fingers because the black flame ritual  simply says by the fingers  and thus is an empirian herself  but malacath defeated the glomeide  queens so it may be that the glomide  queen wasn't allied with the greater  will so the fingers of the gloam-eyed  queen might be allied to another god  another fact that supports this is that  marika is also an imperian and she was  also chosen by the two fingers of the  greater will now one of the assumptions  here is that an empirian is simply like  a status symbol given to a demigod or a  god by an outer god or in this case  specifically the greater will now the  counter argument for this actually made  a new theory about ronnie that is fairly  interesting but is rooted in a lot of  speculation  the theory goes that ronnie was born  from the amber egg that radagan gave  ranala i won't go into details of the  theory because i honestly don't know  much about it and i couldn't find the  original post or the video for this  theory but i've seen a lot of fragmented  comments about it so i just pieced them  all together but i believe the whole  basis of it is the secrets between  ratagan and ranala rani's imperial  status and the cutscene for the second  phase where ronnie spell emerges from  the amber egg but the theory basically  is trying to prove that ronnie is born  from a single god which is ratigan  whether this is true or not well that's  up to you if you do believe it though  then ronnie mikhail and melania are born  from a single god but there's nothing  proving america and the glomide queen  are born from a single god there are  also arguments that the two fingers are  basically the agents of the greater will  which means imperians were chosen by the  greater will  does this mean that imperians are beings  chosen by outer gods if that's the case  how about moog who was chosen by the  formless mother but didn't become an  empyrean and required mikala who was  already an empirian in order to ascend  to godhood his omen blood isn't really a  problem either because both melania and  michaela are also cursed yet they are  imperials now there are a lot more  arguments that people make but if i  cover them all then we'll be here  forever so instead let's move on to the  second theory  the second theory is that empirians are  born from a single god this idea  originally came from the remembrance of  the roth goddess item description which  states the following mikala and melania  are both children of a single god as  such they are both emperians but  suffered afflictions from birth  one was cursed with eternal childhood  and the other harbored wrought within  there have been arguments about the  grammar here to further push the fact  that being born from a single god is  needed but english isn't my first  language so i'll leave that for someone  else to cover in the comments down below  however an additional conversation in  the game that supports this idea was  from gowrie  queen america and her king consort  ranagan were blessed with twin demigods  and melania was one of them  she was born an imperial carrying the  scarlet rot  an empyrean  is no mere demigod  in the age of the elden ring and queen  maniker the precious empyrean was born  a new god to forge a new order  since millennia fought radon and the  great scarlet flower blossomed in aeonia  i have dedicated myself to her  and to the resplendence  of the order of rot  the cycle of decay  and rebirth  he mentions that melania was born as an  emperian meaning it's something that  they are born with rather than it just  being a status symbol of sorts he even  drives the idea that an emperian is no  mere demigod now despite gary saying the  twins were born from america and radigan  we know that in reality they are a  single god which supports the idea that  imperians are not just chosen but have  to be born as an emperian  now counterargument to this is that  there's nothing to prove that america  and the glomide queen are born from a  single god there is also the  conversation of queen america and  radigan which states  spoken echoes linger here  words of queen america  who vanished long ago  if you wish  i will share them with you  in america's own words  o radican  lil hound of the golden order  that yet to become me  thou art yet to become a god  let us be shattered  both  mine other self  meaning radigan may not have been a true  god yet when melania and michelle were  born but this is also nullified by the  fact that ranala and radigan's children  were demigods and we know for a fact  that ranala is not a god so ratagan must  have been  another argument is to debunk the  earlier theory that ronnie is born from  the amber egg and instead is a true  daughter of ranala and ratagan meaning  ronnie is not born from a single god but  is still an emperian  but that's about it it goes deeper than  this but i think this is a good stopping  point before we get to like very crazy  ideas already now as i said earlier  there are a lot more conversations and  arguments for both sides but in my  opinion these are the ones that people  argue the most over whether what is real  or not but now that you have the ideas  from both sides you can probably make  your own assumptions or just go with my  own personal opinion that it's just both  in parents are born a special kind of  demigod and are chosen by an outer god  in any case what do you guys think are  imperiants born or chosen or both let me  know in the comments down below and  please make any discussions down there  civil or at least try to be civil  please

